        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bernard Coard, Maurice Bishop, Hudson Austin\n- Organizations: New Jewel Movement\n- Places: Grenada, Colombia\n- Roles: military government chairman\n- Concepts: socio-economic development, education, black liberation\n\nFacts:\n- Maurice Bishop was a Grenadian politician and the leader of the New Jewel Movement in Grenada.\n- The New Jewel Movement was an effort focused on socio-economic development, education, and black liberation.\n- Maurice Bishop was killed in Grenada.\n- Bernard Coard deposed Maurice Bishop.\n- After Maurice Bishop was killed, Hudson Austin deposed Bernard Coard and formed a military government in Grenada with himself as chairman.",
